id: greater-mutation-evolutionary-peak
name: Evolutionary Peak
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  Adapted to survive even more efficiently than your peers, you are the apex of your kind.
text: >
  Evolutionary Peak: Adapted to survive even more efficiently than your peers, you are the apex of your kind.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Maximum Life Points and Maximum Ki Points by 2 for each Power Level reached.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase your Wound Rolls and Soak Value by 1(bT).
  (3)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Transformation, regain access to the Racial Trait that you replaced with the Factor Trait from the Mutation Factor.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use the Surge Maneuver, double the amount of Life or Ki Points you regain through your selected Surge.

---

# (1) 2 Maximum Life and Ki Points a Power Level (Long-Awaited Perfection (1)'s way).
[passive, effect 1]
life.perLevel += 2;
ki.perLevel += 2;

# (2) Wound Rolls and Soak Value 1(bT).
[passive, effect 2]
wound += 1(bT);
soakValue += 1(bT);

# (3) The Racial Trait the Mutation Factor's Factor Trait replaced, back beside it while this is had (race-traits.mjs, by the exchange
# that Factor Trait remembers). One added through Debug's Add Racial Trait remembers none: the table's.
[passive, effect 3]
allow restoreReplaced.mutation;

# (4) The Surge Maneuver used, once an Encounter: its Surge's Life or Ki Points doubled - asked as its Surge is chosen (the surge-maneuver
# Moment, chat.mjs takeSurge).
[triggered/surge-maneuver, 1/encounter, effect 4]
surge.regainedTimes += 1;
